* LTC4281 Hot Swap Controller Simulation
.lib LTC.lib

* Input Supply (ramps up to ensure clean power-on reset)
V1 IN 0 PWL(0 0 1m 12)

* UV/OV and ON Resistor Divider
* Sets UV rising at ~10.1V and OV rising at ~15.1V
R1 IN N_UV 88.7k
R2 N_UV N_OV 4.12k
R3 N_OV 0 8.25k

* Sense Resistor (10mOhm sets current limit to 2.5A)
Rs IN N_SENSEN 10m

* N-Channel MOSFET
M1 N_SENSEN N_GATE OUT OUT N_MOS
.model N_MOS VDMOS(Rg=1 Vto=2 Rd=5m Rs=1m Rb=5m Kp=50 Cgdmax=2n Cgdmin=1n Cgs=5n Cjo=2n Is=10p)

* Gate Slew Rate Capacitor (limits inrush current)
C_GATE N_GATE OUT 2.2n

* Foldback Divider (releases foldback when OUT reaches ~12V)
R4 OUT N_FB 88.7k
R5 N_FB 0 10.2k

* Timing and Bypass Capacitors
C_TIMER N_TIMER 0 10n
C_INTVCC N_INTVCC 0 1u
C_EECC N_EECC 0 1u

* Output Load (1A nominal load at 12V)
Rload OUT 0 12
Cload OUT 0 100u

* Pull-ups and Dummy Resistors for I2C and GPIO
R_FAULTB N_INTVCC N_FAULTB 10k
R_ALERTB N_INTVCC N_ALERTB 10k
R_SDAI N_INTVCC N_SDAI 10k
R_SCL N_INTVCC N_SCL 10k
R_SDAO N_SDAO 0 1Meg
R_GPIO1 N_GPIO1 0 1Meg
R_GPIO2 N_GPIO2 0 1Meg
R_GPIO3 N_GPIO3 0 1Meg

* LTC4281 Instantiation
* Pin order: VDD SENSEP SENSEN GATE OUT FB OV UV TIMER FAULTB INTVCC ON SDAI SDAO SCL ALERTB ADIN GPIO1 GPIO2 GPIO3 EECC GND
X1 IN IN N_SENSEN N_GATE OUT N_FB N_OV N_UV N_TIMER N_FAULTB N_INTVCC N_UV N_SDAI N_SDAO N_SCL N_ALERTB 0 N_GPIO1 N_GPIO2 N_GPIO3 N_EECC 0 LTC4281

* Analysis Directive
.tran 0 500m
.end
